WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Hazard Hunt + Incident Replay: a warehouse safety mini course (fictional company: Northwind Logistics)

2
00:00:03.005 --> 00:00:12.015
Module 1: a 14-second shift-start intro, captioned and skippable

3
00:00:12.015 --> 00:00:14.517
Skip any cinematic from the first frame (Esc)

4
00:00:14.517 --> 00:00:17.518
Module 2: hunt for hazards in a realistic distribution center

5
00:00:17.518 --> 00:00:23.523
Look closely: some things that seem risky are actually controlled

6
00:00:23.523 --> 00:00:29.526
Flag each hazard and rate its risk, then get feedback on your call

7
00:00:29.526 --> 00:00:32.528
Module 3: replay a near-miss (fictional, nobody is hurt). Pause and decide

8
00:00:32.528 --> 00:00:39.528
You control the pace: pause, scrub, and decide at each point

9
00:00:39.528 --> 00:00:44.532
Module 4: rank fixes with the hierarchy of controls

10
00:00:44.532 --> 00:00:49.536
Module 5: practice reporting a hazard to a busy supervisor

11
00:00:49.536 --> 00:00:54.039
Every decision also works in text mode. Not a compliance course; no certification
